### OS ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.sql
# ...except Flyway migrations, which must always be committed. This blanket
# *.sql rule (meant for ad-hoc local dump/scratch files) silently excluded
# V16 and V17 from git entirely — they were applied directly to the live
# database but the files themselves were never pushed, which is exactly
# what caused a fresh deploy to fail Flyway validation ("Detected applied
# migration not resolved locally"). V18/V19 were caught and force-added
# before that happened to them; V16/V17 were not so lucky.
!src/main/resources/db/migration/*.sql
